  "analysis_type": "descriptive",
  "question": "Can the selected GSE145031 Tomato-positive triplets support a strict sparse source check and a bounded descriptive Figure 1B-D pass under fixed methods?",
  "decision": "Root reviews input integrity, sparse-memory readiness and the descriptive adapter before any frozen checkpointed manual job. This does not authorize a biological run.",
  "strongest_rival": "Source/cell selection and annotation artifacts can change descriptive composition; one pooled library per condition cannot separate time from library or identify a mechanism.",
