  "prior_outcome_exposure": "exposed",
  "exposure_record": "Pinned Choi D1/D2/D2b outcomes and corrections at bfe26b876221cf6c6fa6f9b16a90cfb516b5998d already inspected. The benchmark is exposed; a later freeze will not erase this exposure.",
  "biological_unit": "One pooled two-mouse library per condition; individual mice are not independently identifiable. Cells/barcodes are nested observations, not replicates.",
  "unit_status": "unknown",
  "nesting_and_overlap": "PBS, day 14 and day 28 each have one Tomato-positive pooled library. This is the same published source and historical reanalysis, not independent replication.",
  "population_and_selection": "Only GSM4304609, GSM4304611 and GSM4304613 Tomato-positive raw whitelist triplets; paper thresholds applied directly to raw barcodes, followed by frozen per-library MAD and doublet rules.",
  "contrast": "Metadata stage has no biological contrast. Descriptive stage presents PBS/day-14/day-28 library compositions and marker detection without treating cells as animal replicates.",
  "endpoint": "Metadata: compressed/CRC/order/coordinate integrity, sparse dimensions, nnz, elapsed time and peak memory. Figure1: QC counts, assigned/unassigned/contaminant states, library fractions and marker detection evidence.",
  "methods": "Frozen D1 paper floor/MAD/Scanpy Scrublet with its disclosed undefined-threshold quantile fallback. D2 normalize_total=1e4, log1p, seurat_v3 2000 HVGs on counts, HVG-only scale max10, PCA30, neighbors30, igraph Leiden n_iterations2 seeds0. Fixed primary1.0; sensitivities0.3/0.5/1.0. Corrected D2b annotation; conditional DATP subcluster0.5 only if pAT2 absent and DATP present; no tuning. Bound runtime lock/recipe and source extracts in code.",
  "missingness_and_exclusions": "Reject malformed/hash-mismatched inputs, duplicate coordinates, zeros/non-integer counts, duplicate feature IDs/barcodes, changed feature order or dimension mismatch. No silent repair/sum/dense raw conversion. D1 doublets excluded; contaminants excluded from alveolar denominator, unassigned retained and shown. Missing markers explicitly recorded.",
  "multiplicity": "No biological significance testing or p-values. Declared resolution sensitivities describe measurement choices; they are not independent replications.",
  "precision_status": "not_applicable",
  "precision_basis": "Exact software count/partition/fraction invariants are not biological reproduction tolerances. No effect margin or animal-level precision is claimed or invented.",
  "validation_scope": "internal",
  "design_identifiability": "unsupported",
  "inference_scope": "descriptive",
  "interpretation_limit": "Exposed descriptive benchmark; one pooled library per condition. Fresh numerical differences are reported without thresholding into biological reproduction success; no mechanism or animal-level p-values. A1 is context only, no new question ID.",
  "stop_rule": "Remain draft pending root review and bound manual checkpoint. Hold on provider access, raw hashes/structure, sparse peak-memory readiness, missing cells, method failures or resource/deadline breach. Do not tune thresholds/resolutions to recover five states. Refuse nonempty/non-scoped output paths and retained/subcluster cells insufficient for the fixed 30-neighbor settings; no automatic parameter rescue.",
